msgid "Uncle Kaz, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "What's wrong, Taichi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "It's that guy with the curly hair! I just saw him again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Yeah, he's in that blue truck, probably spying on us again!\r\n"
"It's definitely him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "All right, I'll handle it. Make sure everyone gets inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna go take a look outside. Think you can handle\r\n"
"dinner while I'm gone, Haruka?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Of course. Be careful, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"I'll be fine, don't worry. But if I'm not back in time for\r\n"
"dinner, you guys can start without me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

